Hello Sir/Madam,

I hope this message finds you well.

I am writing to formally request a revision of the interest rate applicable to my existing home loan & home loan insurance, bearing the account numbers H402HHL1072382 & H402GIT1227970 , which I have availed through Bajaj Housing Finance Limited.

I have noticed that the prevailing interest rates for new home loans offered by your BHFL — especially under floating rate schemes—are currently lower (7.45%) than the rate being charged (8.2%) on my loans. As a responsible borrower with a good repayment track record and a high credit score (above 790), I would like to request that my interest rate be aligned with the current applicable rates.

Loan Details:

  *   Loan Account Number 1: H402HHL1072382

  *   Current Interest Rate: 8.2%

  *   Loan Sanction Date: 06 July 2023

  *   Customer Name: Kunal Prabhakarrao Nannore


  *   Loan Account Number 2: H402GIT1227970

  *   Current Interest Rate: 8.2%

