  *   Customer Name: Kunal Prabhakarrao Nannore

I kindly request you to consider switching my loan to a lower interest rate under the applicable floating rate scheme. Please also let me know if there are any charges or formalities involved in processing this request.

Your support in helping reduce the financial burden during the remaining tenure of the loan would be greatly appreciated.

Thank you for your time and assistance. I look forward to a positive response.

Warm regards,
Kunal Prabhakarrao Nannore
